  "description": "<p style=\"text-align: left; font-size: 14px; font-weight: normal;\">Hi loves!&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: left; font-size: 14px; font-weight: normal;\">We are the makers of CaboCr&eacute;me - the world's first cabbag extract cream made to bring comfort to breastfeeding and lactating women. <br><br>It's received thousands of 5-star reviews on Amazon and is trusted by a growing community (more than 500+) of Lactation Consultants and Healthcare Practitioners.</p>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: left; font-size: 14px; font-weight: normal;\"><span>Cabbage leaves are widely-known for their wellness benefits and rooted in traditional remedies across cultures. <br><br>Our line harnesses the rich, enzymatic power of concentrated cabbage extract to remove the guesswork and provide a modern, safer, and more effective way for moms to find comfort.</span></p>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: left; font-size: 14px; font-weight: normal;\"><span>We're seeking someone just like YOU to help us spread the word to more women and postpartum moms who need relief from breast and body pain with CaboCr&eacute;me Extra Strength. <br><br>It contains double the cabbage extract and can new support moms by:&nbsp;&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li dir=\"ltr\" aria-level=\"1\"><span>Relieving the discomfort of engorgement and oversupply</span></li>\r\n<li dir=\"ltr\" aria-level=\"1\">\r\n<p dir=\"ltr\" role=\"presentation\"><span>Helping to control milk flow and associated swelling.</span></p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li dir=\"ltr\" aria-level=\"1\">\r\n<p dir=\"ltr\" role=\"presentation\"><span>Naturally easing clogged ducts and helping women avoid Mastitis</span></p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li dir=\"ltr\" aria-level=\"1\">\r\n<p dir=\"ltr\" role=\"presentation\">Aiding in drying up breastmilk and fast weaning and weaning from the pump</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h2 dir=\"ltr\"><span>Why Choose CaboCr&eacute;me Extra Strength for Weaning?</span><span><br></span></h2>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li dir=\"ltr\" aria-level=\"1\">\r\n<p dir=\"ltr\" role=\"presentation\"><span>Created by an OB-GYN mom with ingredients chosen for quality</span></p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li dir=\"ltr\" aria-level=\"1\">\r\n<p dir=\"ltr\" role=\"presentation\"><span>Trusted by over 1 million moms, lactation consultants, and practitioners</span></p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li dir=\"ltr\" aria-level=\"1\">\r\n<p dir=\"ltr\" role=\"presentation\"><span>Powered by double the concentrated cabbage leaf extract as our original formula</span></p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li dir=\"ltr\" aria-level=\"1\">\r\n<p dir=\"ltr\" role=\"presentation\"><span>A more convenient alternative to traditional cabbage leaves</span></p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li dir=\"ltr\" aria-level=\"1\">\r\n<p dir=\"ltr\" role=\"presentation\"><span>Manufactured under the strictest guidelines in a cosmetic laboratory in the USA</span></p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li dir=\"ltr\" aria-level=\"1\">\r\n<p dir=\"ltr\" role=\"presentation\"><span>Microbiologically-tested for your safety</span></p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li dir=\"ltr\" aria-level=\"1\">\r\n<p dir=\"ltr\" role=\"presentation\"><span>Lightweight and easy to apply on-the-go</span></p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: left; font-size: 14px; font-weight: normal;\">You'll earn 10% of the net sales along with supportive materials and a community that wants to see you win. Email us with any questions at hello@cabocreme.com. We can't wait to connect with you!</p>",
